                    simple_summary: "The State High Court can hear and decide almost all civil and criminal cases that happen within the state. It can act as a trial court or hear appeals from lower local courts in that state.",
                    tags: ["jurisdiction", "civil-cases", "criminal-trials", "state-laws"]
